  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Bring a medium saucepan of salted water to the boil.\n• Cook penne in the boiling water over high heat until ‘al dente’, 12 mins.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/4 cup for 2P / 1/2 cup for 4P), then drain and return pasta to the pan. Drizzle with a little olive oil to prevent sticking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4cc563d3d0197c614de185/step-516d0800.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice zucchini into thin half-moons.\n• Roughly chop capsicum.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4cc563d3d0197c614de185/step-810de710.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook zucchini and capsicum until softened, 5-6 mins.\n• Reduce heat to low and add the brown sugar, Mediterranean seasoning and passata. Simmer until thickened, 1-2 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4cc563d3d0197c614de185/step-c1fc4820.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium. Add cooked pasta, baby spinach leaves, the chilli flakes (if using), the reserved pasta water and butter to the sauce. Stir to combine. Season with pepper.\n• Divide Mediterranean veggie penne between bowls. Top with fetta to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4cc563d3d0197c614de185/step-5e705530.jpg"
    }
  ]
